          "text": "{\"request_id\":\"917165bfdf4b132e28cc8917\",\"rewritten_text\":\"\u201cSo now I\u2019m the owner of a herd of knights,\u201d said I as we rode away. \u201cWho would have imagined I\u2019d ever be listing assets of that variety? I won\u2019t know what to do with them unless I raffle them off. How many are there, Sandy?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cSeven, an it please you, sir, and their squires.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cA fine catch. Who are they? Where do they hang out?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cWhere do they hang out?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cYes, where do they live?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cAh, I understood thee not. That will I quickly tell.\u201d Then she mused softly, tasting the words like they were sweetmeats: \u201cHang they out\u2014hang they out\u2014where hang\u2014where do they hang out; ay, even so; where do they hang out. Truly the phrase hath a fair and winsome savor, and is prettily turned. I will repeat it anon and anon in mine idlesse, so that of perchance I may learn it. Where do they hang out. Indeed! already it trippeth from my tongue, and because\u2014\u201d\\n\\n\u201cDon\u2019t lose track of the cowboys, Sandy.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cCowboys?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cYes; the knights, you remember. You were going to tell me about them. A bit ago, remember? Figuratively, the game\u2019s started.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cGame\u2014\u201d\\n\\n\u201cYes, yes, yes! Step up to the plate. Meaning, set to your statistics and stop using up tinder before the blaze. Give me the lowdown on the knights.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cI will, and gladly will begin. So they two departed and rode into a mighty forest. And\u2014\u201d\\n\\n\u201cGreat Scott!\u201d\\n\\nI knew I\u2019d blundered the instant she began. I\u2019d set her machinery running; that was on me. She\u2019d be thirty days reaching the salient points. She generally launched without preface and ended without arriving anywhere. If you broke in she either ignored you and kept on, or mumbled a couple of words, then backed up and re-delivered the sentence. Interruptions only made matters worse; yet I had to interrupt\u2014and often\u2014to remain alive; a body would perish if he let her monotony drip over him all day long.\\n\\n\u201cGreat Scott!\u201d I groaned. She merely went back and started anew:\\n\\n\u201cSo they two departed and rode into a great forest. And\u2014\u201d\\n\\n\u201cWhich two?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cSir Gawaine and Sir Uwaine. And so they came unto an abbey of monks, and were well lodged. Then on the morn they heard their masses in the abbey, and so they rode forth till they entered a great forest; then Sir Gawaine espied in a valley by a turret twelve fair damsels, and two knights armed upon mighty steeds, and the maidens paced to and fro by a tree.\u201d\"}"
