          "text": "{\"request_id\":\"2983ad183b7a64547e1dae0f\",\"rewritten_text\":\"\u201cWell, Jup,\u201d I said, \u201cwhat\u2019s wrong now? How is your master?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cTo tell de truth, massa, he ain\u2019t near so well as he could be.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cNot well! I\u2019m sorry to hear it. What does he complain of?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cDat\u2019s just it! He never complains of anything\u2014but he\u2019s mighty sick all de same.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cVery sick, Jupiter! Why didn\u2019t you say so right away? Is he stuck in bed?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cNo, he ain\u2019t! He ain\u2019t stuck nowhere\u2014that\u2019s what makes de trouble. My mind is real heavy about poor Massa Will.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cJupiter, I want to understand what you\u2019re saying. You say your master is sick. Hasn\u2019t he told you what\u2019s wrong?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cWhy, massa, no need to get vexed\u2014Massa Will says nothing at all is wrong with him\u2014but then why does he go around looking like this, with his head down and his shoulders up, and as pale as a goose? And he keeps a syphon all de time\u2014\u201d\\n\\n\u201cKeeps a what, Jupiter?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cKeeps a syphon with figures on de slate\u2014the strangest figures I ever saw. I\u2019m starting to get scared, I tell you. Got to keep a mighty close eye on his moves. T\u2019other day he slipped off before sunrise and was gone the whole blessed day. I had a big stick ready cut to give him a real good whipping when he got back\u2014but I\u2019m such a fool I couldn\u2019t do it after all\u2014he looked so very poorly.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cEh? what? ah yes! On the whole, I think you\u2019d better not be too hard on the poor fellow\u2014don\u2019t beat him, Jupiter\u2014he isn\u2019t fit for it. But can\u2019t you guess what caused this illness\u2014or rather this change in him? Has anything unpleasant happened since I saw you?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cNo, massa, nothing unpleasant since then\u2014it was before then, I\u2019m afraid\u2014it was the very day you were there.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cHow? What do you mean?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cWhy, massa, I mean the bug\u2014there, now.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cThe what?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cThe bug. I\u2019m certain Massa Will got bit somewhere \u2019round the head by that gold bug.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cAnd what reason have you, Jupiter, for thinking so?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cClaws enough, massa, and a mouth too. I never saw such a mean bug\u2014he kicks and he bites everything that comes near him. Massa Will caught him first, but had to let him go mighty quick, I tell you\u2014that must be when he got bit. I didn\u2019t like the look of the bug\u2019s mouth at all myself, so I wouldn\u2019t touch him with my fingers, but I picked him up with a piece of paper I found.\u201d\"}"
