          "text": "{\"request_id\":\"eb4fddfa6bf241714a06a04b\",\"rewritten_text\":\"I went from shop to shop, buying whatever was needed to change his appearance. Once that business was done, I headed on my own to Little Britain. Mr. Jaggers was at his desk, but when he saw me enter, he immediately got up and stood before his fire.\\n\\n\u201cNow, Pip,\u201d he said, \u201cbe careful.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cI will, sir,\u201d I replied. I had carefully considered what I intended to say on the way there.\\n\\n\u201cDon\u2019t implicate yourself,\u201d said Mr. Jaggers, \u201cand don\u2019t implicate anyone else. You understand\u2014anyone. Don\u2019t tell me anything: I don\u2019t want to know anything; I\u2019m not curious.\u201d\\n\\nOf course I realized he knew the man had arrived.\\n\\n\u201cI merely want, Mr. Jaggers,\u201d I said, \u201cto reassure myself that what I\u2019ve been told is true. I don\u2019t hope it\u2019s untrue, but I can at least verify it.\u201d\\n\\nMr. Jaggers nodded. \u201cBut did you say \u2018told\u2019 or \u2018informed\u2019?\u201d he asked, tilting his head and staring at the floor as if listening. \u201cTold suggests spoken communication. You can\u2019t have spoken communication with a man in New South Wales, you know.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cI\u2019ll say informed, Mr. Jaggers.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cGood.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cI\u2019ve been informed by a man named Abel Magwitch that he is the long-unknown benefactor.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cThat\u2019s the man,\u201d said Mr. Jaggers, \u201cin New South Wales.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cAnd only him?\u201d I asked.\\n\\n\u201cAnd only him,\u201d said Mr. Jaggers.\\n\\n\u201cI\u2019m not unreasonable enough, sir, to consider you in any way responsible for my mistakes or false conclusions, but I always believed it was Miss Havisham.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cAs you say, Pip,\u201d replied Mr. Jaggers, looking at me coolly and biting his forefinger, \u201cI\u2019m not responsible for that.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cYet it seemed so likely, 