an hear it, can\u2019t I?\u201d Sikes snapped. \u201cI wonder if they can hear it,\u201d said Nancy. \u201cOf course they can,\u201d Sikes replied. \u201cIt was St. Bartholomew\u2019s Fair when I got arrested, and there wasn\u2019t a penny trumpet in the fair I couldn\u2019t hear squeaking. After they locked me up for the night, the noise outside made the old prison seem so quiet I almost bashed my brains out against the iron plates on the door.\u201d\"}"
