          "text": "{\"request_id\":\"e48dbbcfd9122894dbf3b36f\",\"rewritten_text\":\"The exquisitely bred gentlemen wore dainty pendants that chimed as they languished along; these gilded shackles tinkled like delicate bells; and with that chiming, along with the rustle of silk, brocade, and fine linen, a light commotion stirred the air that wafted Saint Antoine and his ravenous hunger to a distance.\\n\\nAttire served as the unfailing charm that held everything in its appointed slot. Everyone was outfitted for a perpetual Fancy Ball. From the Tuileries Palace through Monseigneur and the entire Court, through the Chambers, the Tribunals, and all society (save for the scarecrows), the Fancy Ball extended even to the Common Executioner: who, maintaining the spell, had to perform \u201cfrizzled, powdered, in a gold-laced coat, pumps, and white silk stockings.\u201d At the gallows and the wheel\u2014the axe being seldom used\u2014Monsieur Paris, so styled by his episcopal peers across the provinces, Monsieur Orleans, and the rest, officiated in this delicate attire. And who at Monseigneur\u2019s levee in that seventeen hundred and eightieth year could harbor any doubt that a system rooted in a frizzled hangman, powdered, gold-trimmed, shod in pumps and white silk stockings, would endure until the stars expired!\\n\\nMonseigneur, having relieved his four servants of their burdens and consumed his chocolate, ordered the portals of the Holiest of Holies flung wide, and stepped out. Then, such servility, such cringing and flattery, such abject submission! As for bending in body and soul, nothing remained for Heaven\u2014which might have been one among other reasons why Monseigneur\u2019s supplicants never troubled it.\\n\\nDistributing a word of promise here and a smile there, a whisper for one delighted lackey and a wave of the hand for another, Monseigneur graciously moved through his chambers to the far-off precinct termed the Circumference of Truth. There he turned about, retraced his course, and eventually let the chocolate sprites seal him back inside his sanctuary, where he vanished from view.\\n\\nWith the spectacle concluded, the faint flutter became quite a brisk squall, and the dainty little bells jingled down the stairs. Soon only one figure remained of the throng, and he, hat tucked beneath his arm and snuffbox in hand, slowly paced past the mirrors toward the exit.\\n\\n\u201cI consign you,\u201d said this figure, halting at the final door on his way and facing the direction of the sanctuary, \u201cto the Devil!\u201d\\n\\nWith that declaration, he flicked the snuff from his fingers as though brushing dust from his feet, and calmly descended the stairs.\"}"
