ning to the program.\\n\\n\u201cPerhaps,\u201d Mr. Elliot murmured, \u201cI\u2019ve known your character longer than you suspect.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cIndeed? How so? You could only have known me since I came to Bath, unless my family mentioned me beforehand.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cI knew of you long before you came to Bath. I heard you described by people who knew you well. I\u2019ve been acquainted with you in reputation for many years. Your appearance, your temperament, your accomplishments, your manner\u2014they were all familiar to me.\u201d\\n\\nMr. Elliot was not disappointed in the curiosity he aimed to spark. No one can resist the allure of such a mystery.\"}"
