 not help replying briskly,\\n\\n\u201cMr. Elton, this is the most extraordinary behavior! I can explain it only one way: you are not yourself, or you couldn\u2019t speak either to me or of Harriet like this. Get hold of yourself enough to say no more, and I will try to forget it.\u201d\\n\\nBut Mr. Elton had drunk only enough wine to lift his spirits, not enough to muddle his thoughts. He knew exactly what he meant; and after vehemently protesting that her suspicion was most unfair and briefly mentioning his respect for Miss Smith as her friend\u2014though admitting he was astonished she was mentioned at all\u2014he returned to the subject of his own passion and pressed hard for a favorable answer.\"}"
