d on the floor. The victims must have been sitting with their backs to the window; and, judging by the time between the creature\u2019s entry and their screams, it seems likely they didn\u2019t notice it right away. The shutter banging shut would naturally have been blamed on the wind.\\n\\nAs the sailor looked in, the gigantic animal had grabbed Madame L\u2019Espanaye by the hair\u2014left loose because she had been combing it\u2014and was brandishing the razor around her face, mimicking a barber\u2019s motions.\"}"
