 a room with. I reminded him I was your friend and asked what he meant. He told me. He said it right there in front of everyone. It was dreadful! Why is your friendship so disastrous for young men? There was that poor boy in the Guards who killed himself. You were his close friend. Then there was Sir Henry Ashton, who had to leave England with a ruined name.\"}"
