pell on the well.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cGod\u2019s wounds, then we are ruined!\u201d\\n\\n\u201cPossibly.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cBut not certainly? You mean, not certainly?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cThat\u2019s right.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cWherefore, you also mean that when he says no one can break the spell\u2014\u201d\\n\\n\u201cYes, when he says that, he isn\u2019t necessarily right. There are conditions under which trying to break it might have a chance\u2014a small, tiny chance\u2014of success.\u201d\"}"
