          "text": "{\"request_id\":\"7e85d1040a0c3e86a8862c11\",\"rewritten_text\":\"\u201cWell, Jup,\u201d said I, \u201cwhat's wrong now?\u2014how is your master getting on?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cWhy, to tell de truth, massa, him ain\u2019t so monstrous well as he might be.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cNot well! I\u2019m very sorry to hear that. What does he complain of?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cDat\u2019s jes it!\u2014him neber grumble \u2019bout anyt\u2019ing\u2014yet him mighty sick all de same.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cVery ill, Jupiter!\u2014why not say so at once? Is he laid up in bed?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cNo, not a bit!\u2014he ain\u2019t tied down nowhere\u2014that\u2019s the very rub\u2014my mind is getting mighty heavy \u2019bout poor Massa Will.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cJupiter, I\u2019d like to be clear what you\u2019re telling me. You insist your master is ill. Hasn\u2019t he told you what troubles him?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cWhy, massa, \u2019taint worth while to take offense \u2019bout it\u2014Massa Will says nothing at all\u2019s wrong wid him\u2014but den why he go round looking like dis, wid his head drooped and his shoulders humped, and as pale as a goose? And den he keeps a siphon de whole time\u2014\u201d\\n\\n\u201cKeeps a what, Jupiter?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cKeeps a siphon wid figures on the slate\u2014the oddest figures I ever did see. I\u2019m starting to feel scared, I tell ye. Hab to keep a mighty sharp eye on his moves. T\u2019other day he slipped me \u2019fore sunrise and stayed gone all de blessed day. I had a big switch cut ready to give him a smart thrashing when he showed up\u2014but I\u2019m such a fool I couldn\u2019t do it after all\u2014he looked so terribly poorly.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cEh?\u2014what?\u2014oh yes!\u2014all things considered, I think you\u2019d better not be too harsh with the poor fellow\u2014don\u2019t whip him, Jupiter\u2014he\u2019s hardly fit for that\u2014but can\u2019t you guess what\u2019s brought on this illness, or rather this change in behavior? Has anything disagreeable happened since I last saw you?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cNo, massa, nothing bad\u2019s happened since den\u2014it was before den, I fear\u2014it was the very day you was dere.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cHow? what are you implying?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cWhy, massa, I mean the bug\u2014there now.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cThe what?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cThe bug,\u2014I\u2019m mighty certain Massa Will got bit somewhere about the head by dat goold-bug.\u201d\\n\\n\u201cAnd on what grounds, Jupiter, do you rest that notion?\u201d\\n\\n\u201cPlenty o\u2019 grounds, massa, and mouth besides. I never seen such a cursed bug\u2014he kicks and bites everything he comes near. Massa Will caught him first, but had to let him go again right quick, I tell ye\u2014then must ha\u2019 been the moment he got bit. I didn\u2019t like the looks of the bug\u2019s mouth myself, nohow, so I wouldn\u2019t touch him wid my finger, but I nabbed him with a scrap of paper I picked up.\u201d\"}"
